Package: shinysapfluxr
Type: Package
Title: Interactive Shiny Interface for Sap Flow Analysis
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Grant", "Joyce", email = "neez1977@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = "Developer")
    )
Description: Interactive web application for processing and visualising heat pulse
    velocity data from ICT SFM1x sensors. Provides an easy-to-use interface for
    students and researchers to import data (with optional clock-drift and
    weather/VPD), configure probe and wood properties, calculate heat pulse
    velocity with quality flagging, apply spacing and wound corrections, calibrate
    secondary methods and apply sDMA (Selectable Dual Method Approach), convert to
    sap flux density and tree water use, and aggregate to daily totals. Generates a
    fully reproducible R script and publication-quality plots. Built on the
    sapfluxr package.
License: GPL-3
